LOGBOOK.md:263:- DECISION: `application-groups` is now **prohibited on all four macOS targets** (production *and* probe) and `required` on all four iOS targets — new rule **G4**: an App Group is granted only where a *currently selected* mechanism uses one of the grants the entitlement actually confers. Reopening conditions are deliberately **grant-specific** (group-prefixed Mach service / group-prefixed POSIX IPC / provider moved into a user context), so "the spec mentions App Groups" or "a shipping product carries it" cannot reopen the row.
