LOGBOOK.md:295:- ANOMALY: **Tailscale carries the Sparkle exception while `com.apple.security.app-sandbox` is `false`** — the same product cited as D-4 evidence that hosts are routinely unsandboxed. The exception is inert without the sandbox, so "shipping products carry this key" is not by itself evidence that a key is required. Worth remembering when mining installed apps for entitlement precedent: presence proves the shape is *accepted*, never that it is *needed*.
